2 0 obj
<< /Length 5454 >>
stream
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 775.53 Tm (Where AI sits in the OS) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 760.88 Tm (Milo is the assistant in the OS. It reads what is in your workspace and answers questions, proposes tasks and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 746.48 Tm (prepares actions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 728.68 Tm (The Studio creates posts: copy, image and film, based on your brand passport and the brief you give.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 710.88 Tm (The brand scan reads a website and derives colours, typefaces and tone from it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 693.08 Tm (The CRM and the calendar use AI for summaries, draft messages and suggestions for the best moment to post.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 671.28 Tm (Which models, and where they run) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 656.63 Tm (We use models from Google \(Gemini\), OpenAI, Anthropic and Higgsfield. Which model performs a task can differ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 642.23 Tm (per feature and per moment; we choose on quality, speed and cost.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 624.43 Tm (The current list of providers, with where they process and on what basis data leaves the EEA, is in Annex C of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 610.03 Tm (the data processing agreement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 592.23 Tm (We do not build models and we do not train models. We use existing models and give them context from your) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 577.83 Tm (workspace.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 556.03 Tm (What happens to your input) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 541.38 Tm (What you enter, or what comes from your connected sources, goes to a model only to carry out your instruction,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 526.98 Tm (and only the part needed for it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 509.18 Tm (With every model provider it is contractually excluded that your input is used to train their models. We do not use) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 494.78 Tm (your data to train or fine-tune a model either.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 476.98 Tm (We do use a knowledge layer: texts and examples with which we ground a model so the answer fits SocialNow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 462.58 Tm (That layer contains no customer data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 444.78 Tm (Keys you enter for Odoo, Meta, Google or your social channels never go to a model.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 422.98 Tm (Disclosure of AI content) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 408.33 Tm (Article 50 of the AI Act \(Regulation \(EU\) 2024/1689\) requires those who create synthetic content to disclose it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 393.93 Tm (We implement that as follows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 376.13 Tm (In the OS it is always visible that a post was created by a model: the Studio shows it while creating, and a post) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 361.73 Tm (carries that origin with it in your media.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 343.93 Tm (Images and film created with a model carry the provenance data the provider attaches, including C2PA data) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 329.53 Tm (where the model supplies it. We do not strip it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 311.73 Tm (If you publish a post on a channel with its own AI label, such as Meta or TikTok, setting that label is up to you. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 297.33 Tm (cannot enforce it for you, and we do not quietly switch it off.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 275.53 Tm (What AI in the OS does not do) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 260.88 Tm (Nothing is published on your behalf without you or a team member with write rights clicking on it. A model) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 246.48 Tm (proposes; a person decides.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 228.68 Tm (No decision is taken about a person that produces legal effects or similarly significantly affects them. There is no) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 214.28 Tm (automated decision-making within the meaning of Article 22 GDPR.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 196.48 Tm (There is no scoring, ranking or profiling on characteristics of people beyond what you record in your own CRM.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 178.68 Tm (One client's data is never used to produce an answer for another client. A workspace is a boundary, for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 164.28 Tm (model too.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 142.48 Tm (What a model can get wrong) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 127.83 Tm (Models sometimes invent something that looks right. They mix up names and numbers, they fill an empty space,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 113.43 Tm (and they are just as confident when they are wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 95.63 Tm (So: check every text and every figure before you publish, certainly for prices, claims, names and commitments.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 81.23 Tm (The OS does not put an amount or a promise into a post that it did not take from your source, but a model asked) Tj ET
0.45 0.45 0.45 rg BT /F1 7.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69291338582678 47.69 Tm (AI statement \267 SocialNow \267 socialnow.nl/ai) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 524.18 47.69 Tm (2 / 3) Tj ET 0 0 0 rg
endstream
