BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 779.53 Tm (for a text may still add a sentence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 761.73 Tm (Responsibility for what finally goes out under your name lies with you. That is also stated in the terms of service.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 739.93 Tm (Copyright and image rights) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 725.28 Tm (Images created with a model on your brief may be used as agreed in the terms of service. The legal position of AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 710.88 Tm (imagery is in motion; we give no guarantee that copyright subsists in such imagery, and therefore none that you) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 696.48 Tm (can stop others from making something similar.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 678.68 Tm (If you supply your own images, for example photos of your team or products, you declare that you are allowed to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 664.28 Tm (use them and that the people shown have consented. We use your images only for your own posts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 646.48 Tm (Do not ask a model to reproduce the work or the face of an existing person or brand. That is an infringement,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 632.08 Tm (even when a model simply does it.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 610.28 Tm (Questions and objection) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 595.63 Tm (If you want to know which model produced a particular post, or you want a certain kind of processing to stop:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 581.23 Tm (privacy@socialnow.nl. We can switch features off per workspace.) Tj ET
